msgid "Set up AeroThemePlasma"
msgstr "设置 AeroThemePlasma"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步"

msgid "AeroThemePlasma Setup Wizard"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma 设置向导"

msgid "Welcome to the AeroThemePlasma first time setup wizard."
msgstr "欢迎使用 AeroThemePlasma 首次设置向导。"

msgid "Microsoft® Windows™ is a registered trademark of Microsoft® Corporation. This name is used for referential use only, and does not aim to usurp copyrights from Microsoft. Microsoft Ⓒ 2025 All rights reserved. All respective resources and assets belong to Microsoft Corporation."
msgstr "Microsoft® Windows™ 是 Microsoft® Corporation 的注册商标。此名称仅用于指代，无意侵犯 Microsoft 的版权。Microsoft Ⓒ 2025 保留所有权利。所有相关资源与素材均归 Microsoft Corporation 所有。"

msgid "Look and Feel"
msgstr "外观与感觉"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

msgid "AeroThemePlasma will change the look and feel of the following parts of your system:\n- Plasma Style\n- Application Style\n- Color Scheme\n- Icon and Sound Theme\n- Window Effects and Animations\n\nTo review these changes in detail, see the [install guide](https://gitgud.io/wackyideas/aerothemeplasma/-/blob/master/INSTALL.md?ref_type=heads). These settings can be changed later at any time."
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma 将更改系统以下部分的外观与感觉：\n- Plasma 样式\n- 应用程序样式\n- 配色方案\n- 图标和声音主题\n- 窗口特效与动画\n\n如需详细了解这些更改，请参阅[安装指南](https://gitgud.io/wackyideas/aerothemeplasma/-/blob/master/INSTALL.md?ref_type=heads)。这些设置之后可随时更改。"

msgid "These configurations will also be applied to the regular Plasma session."
msgstr "这些配置也会应用到常规 Plasma 会话。"

msgid "SDDM Theme"
msgstr "SDDM 主题"

msgid "AeroThemePlasma will change the look and feel of the login screen (SDDM), as well as synchronize settings between Plasma and SDDM.\n"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma 将更改登录屏幕（SDDM）的外观与感觉，并在 Plasma 与 SDDM 之间同步设置。\n"

msgid "These operations require administrator privileges."
msgstr "这些操作需要管理员权限。"

msgid "Cursor Theme"
msgstr "光标主题"

msgid "AeroThemePlasma will change the default cursor theme globally in order for SDDM to recognize it.\n"
msgstr "AeroThemePlasma 将全局更改默认光标主题，以便 SDDM 能够识别。\n"

msgid "This operation requires administrator privileges."
msgstr "此操作需要管理员权限。"

msgid "Completing the AeroThemePlasma Setup Wizard"
msgstr "正在完成 AeroThemePlasma 设置向导"

msgid "Finish"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "Thank you for trying out AeroThemePlasma!"
msgstr "感谢您试用 AeroThemePlasma！"

msgid "Click Finish to exit the AeroThemePlasma wizard."
msgstr "单击“完成”退出 AeroThemePlasma 向导。"

